1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,626
May brought the third mini album: CHOOM — Korean for dance.

2
00:00:04,626 --> 00:00:13,762
July brought the statistic that would have been unthinkable at debut: number thirty-five on the US Mediabase Top 40, the American radio chart.

3
00:00:13,762 --> 00:00:16,971
First BABYMONSTER entry.

4
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:23,672
K-pop's gatekeeping metric, measured not in YouTube views but in actual spins on US stations.

